"_comment":"Doku uniqueness check list (19 Oct 2026). Common British English words, 3-5 letters: every lower-case word in the en-GB Hunspell dictionary (wooorm dictionary-en-gb) with wordfreq Zipf >= 3.0, minus offensive words and abbreviations nobody would play (vowel-less forms like LBS and HWY, Roman numerals, EST, ETD...). Used ONLY to prove a Doku has no second all-real-word fill (tools/doku-broad-check.js, tools/pinwheel-regen.js); never to build puzzles. The engine word list is added on top at check time."}
